meta {
  name: 01. Upload Attachment (Protected)
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/attachments/upload
  body: multipartForm
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:multipart-form {
  file: @file()
  type: PROFILE_IMAGE
  is_public: true
}

vars:post-response {
  attachmentId: res.body.data.id
  attachmentObjectKey: res.body.data.object_key
}

docs {
  # Upload Attachment (Protected)

  **Method:** `POST`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/attachments/upload`
  **Auth:** Required (Bearer Token)

  ## Description

  Uploads a file directly through the backend server using `multipart/form-data`. The server inspects the binary content for MIME sniffing, validates the file size against configured limits for the attachment type, extracts dimensions if it is an image, generates a SHA-256 hash, stores the object in RustFS / S3, and records metadata in PostgreSQL.

  ## Request

  ### Headers

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | Bearer access token (`Bearer <token>`) |
  | `Content-Type` | `string` | Yes | `multipart/form-data` |

  ### Form Data

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `file` | `file` | Yes | Binary media file to upload |
  | `type` | `string` | Yes | `PROFILE_IMAGE`, `GROUP_COVER`, `GALLERY_IMAGE`, `GALLERY_VIDEO`, `EXPENSE_RECEIPT`, `SETTLEMENT_RECEIPT` |
  | `group_id` | `int64` | No | Associated squad/group ID |
  | `expense_id` | `int64` | No | Associated expense ID |
  | `is_public` | `boolean` | No | Override public access (`true`/`false`) |

  ## Response

  **`201 Created`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 1,
      "uploaded_by_user_id": 1,
      "group_id": null,
      "expense_id": null,
      "type": "PROFILE_IMAGE",
      "original_filename": "avatar.png",
      "object_key": "attachments/profile_image/2026/11/550e8400_avatar.png",
      "thumbnail_object_key": null,
      "mime_type": "image/png",
      "file_size_bytes": 1048576,
      "file_hash": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "width": 800,
      "height": 800,
      "duration_seconds": null,
      "is_public": true,
      "access_url": "http://127.0.0.1:9000/doratou-storage/attachments/profile_image/2026/11/550e8400_avatar.png",
      "uploaded_at": "2026-11-02T18:00:00Z",
      "created_at": "2026-11-02T18:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-02T18:00:00Z"
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  * `400 Bad Request` — Missing file, invalid mime type, or payload errors
  * `401 Unauthorized` — Missing or invalid Bearer token
  * `413 Payload Too Large` — File size exceeds limit for specified type
  * `503 Service Unavailable` — RustFS / S3 storage is unreachable
}
